<section id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading" class="pt-32 md:pt-48 pb-32 md:pb-40">
  <h2 id="about-heading" class="reveal font-display font-semibold text-[clamp(3.5rem,11.5vw,179.194px)] tracking-[-0.04em] leading-[0.88] text-text-primary p-2">
    Introduction
  </h2>
  <div class="mt-20 md:mt-28 flex flex-col md:grid md:grid-cols-8 md:gap-6 items-start">
    <div class="md:col-start-3 md:col-span-1 mb-4 md:mb-0 p-2">
      <span class="reveal font-mono text-[18.8px] uppercase tracking-widest text-text-muted pt-1 block" style="animation-delay: calc(var(--stagger) * 1)">About</span>
    </div>
    <div class="md:col-start-4 md:col-span-5 lg:col-span-4 space-y-10 p-2">
      <p class="reveal font-display text-[23.04px] leading-[1.6] text-[#1e1e1f] p-2" style="animation-delay: calc(var(--stagger) * 2)">
        I'm a builder at heart, driven by a passion for crafting clean, reliable software and intuitive digital experiences. My approach is rooted in curiosity and a love for exploring the intersections of thoughtful frontend design, scalable backend architecture, and practical AI integration.
      </p>
      <p class="reveal font-display text-[23.04px] leading-[1.6] text-[#1e1e1f] p-2" style="animation-delay: calc(var(--stagger) * 3)">
        I believe great software isn't just about passing tests, but about creating smooth, dependable experiences that solve genuine problems. Whether I'm engineering cross-platform mobile apps, building serverless developer tooling, or architecting full-stack web applications, I take the time to understand the nuances of a project and craft software that resonates.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
